            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "WN25-DC-000390 - The Windows Server 2025 \"Deny log on as a service\" user right must be configured to include no accounts or groups (blank) on domain controllers."
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "family": "windows"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "name": "platform",
                "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
